{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026jVDYmxOwAs1793701024.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>行政長官李家超到北京和上海訪問。</p><p></p><p>李家超上午乘坐飛機出發到北京，到埗時有中央港澳辦一局和北京市港澳辦代表迎接，特首辦主任葉文娟都有隨行。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.CE-1600_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026f5IqJKp67n1793701040.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>李家超明日會出席京港洽談會開幕式和致辭，今屆洽談會主題是「揚帆十五五、京港共未來」。</p><p></p><p>之後李家超會轉往上海，出席周四舉行的第九屆進博會暨虹橋國際經濟論壇開幕式，參觀香港展區和香港企業展位，並於虹橋國際經濟論壇香港分論壇致辭，他亦會與上海市官員會面。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T11:21:58.580889+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":193,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T10:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T05:38:39.897230+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T11:18:43.347499+00:00","content_hash":"07950710a12286aeac9eed2bf7ab513624e2c61a3a2a0159dbfd59685a8b2384","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-03T11:21:58.580889+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}